# A copy of any string into a disjunction of two: the compatibility rules find
# a source value, "", that the target rejects.
-- source.cue --
kind: string
-- target.cue --
kind: "a" | "b"
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {kind: v0_0.kind}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.kind copies v0_0.kind, which is now "a" | "b", which does not accept every value of the prior string (compat rule value-narrowed) (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:14
